Error [jet.CollectingLoopBreakPayload]: This collecting loop cannot use a break payload
  --> tests/ui/yielding_loop_break_payload.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |             break 9
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: Its result is already the accumulated List, so a second payload would give one exit two result channels
 Fix: Write `break` to return the accumulated list
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0075
